{title: Blessed Quietness}
{artist: Manie Ferguson & W. S. Marshall}
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 80}

Verse 1
[F]Joys are flowing [Bb]like a [F]river since the Comforter has [C]come;
[F]he abides with [Bb]us for[F]ever, makes the [C]trusting heart his [F]home.

Chorus
[F]Blessed quietness, [Bb]holy [F]quietness — what assurance [C]in my soul!
[F]On the stormy [Bb]sea he [F]speaks peace to me — how the [C]billows cease to [F]roll!
